+ *	Copyright (C) 2024 ALIENTEK - All Rights Reserved
+ *  ALIENTEK MIPI LCD : 5.5 inch 720x1280, 1080x1920 and 10.1 inch 800x1280
+ *  Alientek MIPI LCD : 5.5 inch use IC HX839X and 10.1 inch use IC ili9881
+ */
+
